This project's code is MIT licensed. It uses two third-party datasets under
their own terms, not covered by this license:

- PSRA Residential Property Price Register - the source website states the
  PSRA does not warrant the data and requires attribution to the PSRA when
  reused. This project attributes it throughout (see README.md).
- CSO Residential Property Price Index (RPPI / HPM09), via the PxStat API -
  Central Statistics Office of Ireland, used under CSO's open-data terms
  (https://www.cso.ie/en/aboutus/lgdp/csogeneralpolicies/csoopendatalicence/).
